  "description": "A fully animated Expander (collapsible accordion panel) for Windows Forms with smooth 60 FPS height transitions, a rotating anti-aliased chevron and dual-text headers. Includes native Dark and Light themes, 6 design styles (DashboardPremium, FluentGlass, MaterialFlat, SoftNeumorphic, Cyberpunk, Custom) with a complete custom color palette, brand AccentColor, adjustable AnimationDuration and keyboard toggling. Drag-and-drop child controls directly in the Visual Studio Designer via ParentControlDesigner. Zero external dependencies — pure GDI+ and WinForms. Targets .NET Framework 4.7.2/4.8 and .NET 6/8 (Windows).",
