  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- 60 FPS ease-out height expansion with a synchronized rotating chevron.\n\t\t\t- Dual-text headers (Primary + Secondary) with electric cyan hover glow.\n\t\t\t- ThemeMode (Dark/Light) x 6 styles, including a fully customizable Custom palette.\n\t\t\t- AccentColor branding (#00F0FF) and AnimationDuration (50-2000 ms).\n\t\t\t- Keyboard support: Space/Enter toggling with accessible role.\n\t\t\t- ParentControlDesigner drag-and-drop child hosting in Visual Studio.\n\t\t\t- Flicker-free: WS_EX_COMPOSITED | WS_CLIPCHILDREN + single-pass rendering.",
